# Optional deploy failure alert (#866). Install as <deploy dir>/.deploy-alert.env, mode 0600, owned by the deploy user.
# bootstrap-vps.sh creates it from this template when it is missing.
#
# This is deliberately NOT in .env.production: compose.yml injects that whole file into the api, worker, web and migrate
# containers, and a webhook URL is a bearer secret that none of them need. deploy.sh reads this file itself.
#
# DEPLOY_ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL is an https:// incoming-webhook URL (Slack-compatible JSON POST). When set, any failing deploy
# posts the commit SHA, failing step, exit code and applied migration filenames (no PHI); exit 75 is labelled "operator
# decision required". An exported DEPLOY_ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL in the deploy's environment wins over this file.
# Leave it commented out to disable. Delivery failures never fail the deploy.
# DEPLOY_ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL=
